{:edb/db-before-t 2774 :edb/db-after-t 2775 :edb/tx-data [[13194139536087 50 #inst "2026-10-09T14:43:18.470Z" 13194139536087 true] [17592186129109 1020 #edb/ref 17592186383048 13194139536087 true] [17592186129109 1020 #edb/ref 17592186383055 13194139536087 true] [17592186129109 1020 #edb/ref 17592186383062 13194139536087 true] [17592186129194 1020 #edb/ref 17592186383069 13194139536087 true] [17592186129437 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139536087 true] [17592186129437 1100 "> A calculator is required to answer this question.\n\nFind the value of the double sum\n\n$∑_(i = 1)^(30)∑_(j = 1)^(30)2a_{i}(b_{j} - 2)$\n\ngiven that\n\n$∑_(i = 1)^(30)a_{i} = 42, ∑_(j = 1)^(30)b_{j} = 70$." 13194139536087 false] [17592186129437 1100 "Find the value of the double sum\n\n$$\n{\\sum }_{i=1}^{30}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{30}2{a}_{i}({b}_{j}-2)\n$$\n\ngiven that\n\n$$\n{\\sum }_{i=1}^{30}{a}_{i}=42,\\,{\\sum }_{j=1}^{30}{b}_{j}=70.\n$$" 13194139536087 true] [17592186129437 1145 "The product rule for double summations states that\n\n$$\n{\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}{a}_{i}{b}_{j}={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{a}_{i}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}{b}_{j}.\n$$\n\nSo, using the product rule for double summations, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\sum }_{i=1}^{30}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{30}2{a}_{i}({b}_{j}-2) & ={\\sum }_{i=1}^{30}2{a}_{i}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{30}({b}_{j}-2).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, using the rules for single summations, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\sum }_{i=1}^{30}2{a}_{i}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{30}({b}_{j}-2) & =(2{\\sum }_{i=1}^{30}{a}_{i})\\cdot ({\\sum }_{j=1}^{30}{b}_{j}-{\\sum }_{j=1}^{30}2) \\\\  & =(2{\\sum }_{i=1}^{30}{a}_{i})\\cdot ({\\sum }_{j=1}^{30}{b}_{j}-2{\\sum }_{j=1}^{30}1) \\\\  & =(2\\cdot 42)\\cdot (70-2\\cdot 30) \\\\  & =(84)\\cdot (70-60) \\\\  & =(84)\\cdot (10) \\\\  & =840\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139536087 true] [17592186383048 1017 #edb/ref 17592186383049 13194139536087 true] [17592186383048 1089 "q-149667" 13194139536087 true] [17592186383048 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139536087 true] [17592186383048 1100 "Find the value of the double sum\n\n$$\n{\\sum }_{i=1}^{30}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{10}(2{a}_{ij}-{b}_{ij})\n$$\n\ngiven that\n\n$$\n{\\sum }_{i=1}^{30}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{10}{a}_{ij}=75,\\,{\\sum }_{i=1}^{30}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{10}{b}_{ij}=80.\n$$" 13194139536087 true] [17592186383048 1113 #uuid "68736947-77b6-5f6a-9fd0-b3e7519c62df" 13194139536087 true] [17592186383048 1145 "The sum and constant multiple rules for double summations state that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}({a}_{ij}+{b}_{ij}) & ={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}{a}_{ij}+{\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}{b}_{ij}, \\\\ {\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}k{a}_{ij} & =k{\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}{a}_{ij}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nApplying these rules to the given sum, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\sum }_{i=1}^{30}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{10}(2{a}_{ij}-{b}_{ij}) & ={\\sum }_{i=1}^{30}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{10}2{a}_{ij}-{\\sum }_{i=1}^{30}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{10}{b}_{ij} \\\\  & =2{\\sum }_{i=1}^{30}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{10}{a}_{ij}-{\\sum }_{i=1}^{30}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{10}{b}_{ij} \\\\  & =2\\cdot 75-80 \\\\  & =150-80 \\\\  & =70.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139536087 true] [17592186383049 1000 #edb/ref 17592186383050 13194139536087 true] [17592186383049 1000 #edb/ref 17592186383051 13194139536087 true] [17592186383049 1000 #edb/ref 17592186383052 13194139536087 true] [17592186383049 1000 #edb/ref 17592186383053 13194139536087 true] [17592186383049 1000 #edb/ref 17592186383054 13194139536087 true] [17592186383049 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139536087 true] [17592186383049 1041 "selection" 13194139536087 true] [17592186383049 1104 #edb/ref 17592186383050 13194139536087 true] [17592186383049 1110 #uuid "63b3b809-bb0e-57d9-b036-32653ccb2067" 13194139536087 true] [17592186383050 1034 "70" 13194139536087 true] [17592186383050 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536087 true] [17592186383050 1111 #uuid "6c95a140-bbbd-5ee9-bc29-08a0c0d14f6f" 13194139536087 true] [1759218