7f9b-57df-8064-355cc4b0ce67" 13194139536087 true] [17592186383069 1145 "The product rule for double summations states that\n\n$$\n{\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}{a}_{i}{b}_{j}={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{a}_{i}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}{b}_{j}.\n$$\n\nSo, using the product rule for double summations, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\sum }_{i=1}^{15}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{10}({a}_{i}+1)({b}_{j}+1) & ={\\sum }_{i=1}^{15}({a}_{i}+1){\\sum }_{j=1}^{10}({b}_{j}+1).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, using the rules for single summations, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\sum }_{i=1}^{15}({a}_{i}+1){\\sum }_{j=1}^{10}({b}_{j}+1) & =({\\sum }_{i=1}^{15}{a}_{i}+{\\sum }_{i=1}^{15}1)\\cdot ({\\sum }_{j=1}^{10}{b}_{j}+{\\sum }_{j=1}^{10}1) \\\\  & =(20+15)\\cdot (10+10) \\\\  & =(35)\\cdot (20) \\\\  & =700.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139536087 true] [17592186383070 1000 #edb/ref 17592186383071 13194139536087 true] [17592186383070 1000 #edb/ref 17592186383072 13194139536087 true] [17592186383070 1000 #edb/ref 17592186383073 13194139536087 true] [17592186383070 1000 #edb/ref 17592186383074 13194139536087 true] [17592186383070 1000 #edb/ref 17592186383075 13194139536087 true] [17592186383070 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139536087 true] [17592186383070 1041 "selection" 13194139536087 true] [17592186383070 1104 #edb/ref 17592186383072 13194139536087 true] [17592186383070 1110 #uuid "7c70c7b8-bfe4-57b2-8a6c-c6884b9d1f3b" 13194139536087 true] [17592186383071 1034 "800" 13194139536087 true] [17592186383071 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536087 true] [17592186383071 1111 #uuid "af691731-3473-5da2-bafc-ea35e67e03e8" 13194139536087 true] [17592186383072 1034 "700" 13194139536087 true] [17592186383072 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536087 true] [17592186383072 1111 #uuid "fbfd8841-b20f-543a-a06f-a1c49710e0e8" 13194139536087 true] [17592186383073 1034 "500" 13194139536087 true] [17592186383073 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536087 true] [17592186383073 1111 #uuid "f9af8000-1cae-56e5-9008-4aac1